msgstr "For more information, review the Pip documentation on using proxy servers `here <https://pip.pypa.io/en/stable/user_guide/#using-a-proxy-server>`_."

#: ../../library/automation/tasks.rst:460
msgid "**CentOS 7 / Python 2.7 (RHEL system Python)**"
msgstr "**CentOS 7 / Python 2.7 (RHEL system Python)**"

#: ../../library/automation/tasks.rst:462
msgid ""
"With a fresh install of |morpheus| on a default build of CentOS 7, Python"
" Tasks will not function due to the missing requirement of "
"``virtualenv``."
msgstr "With un/una fresh install de |morpheus| en un/una predeterminado/predeterminada build de CentOS 7, Python Tareas será/n ningún function due a el/la missing requirement de ``virtualenv``."

#: ../../library/automation/tasks.rst:464
msgid ""
"If you attempt to run a python task, you will get an error similar to the"
" following:"
msgstr "Si you attempt to run a python task, you will get an error similar to the following:"

#: ../../library/automation/tasks.rst:466
msgid ""
"Task Execution Failed on Attempt 1\n"
"sudo: /tmp/py-8ae51ebf-749c-4354-b6e4-11ce541afad5/bin/python: command "
"not found"
msgstr "Tarea Execution Failed on Attempt 1\nsudo: /tmp/py-8ae51ebf-749c-4354-b6e4-11ce541afad5/bin/python: command not found"

#: ../../library/automation/tasks.rst:471
msgid ""
"In order to run |morpheus| Python Tasks in CentOS 7, install "
"``virtualenv``: ``yum install python-virtualenv``"
msgstr "In order to run |morpheus| Python Tareas in CentOS 7, install ``virtualenv``: ``yum install python-virtualenv``"

#: ../../library/automation/tasks.rst:473
msgid ""
"If you require ``python3``, you can specify the binary to be used while "
"building the virtual environment. In a default install, do the following:"
" ``yum install python3``. Then, in your |morpheus| Python Task, specify "
"the binary in the PYTHON BINARY field as \"/bin/python3\". This will "
"build a virtual environment in ``/tmp`` using the ``python3`` binary, "
"which is equivalent to making a virtual environment like so: ``virtualenv"
" ~/venv -p /bin/python3``."
msgstr "Si you require ``python3``, you can specify the binary to be used while building the virtual environment. In a default install, do the following: ``yum install python3``. Then, in your |morpheus| Python Tarea, specify the binary in the PYTHON BINARY field as \"/bin/python3\". This will build a virtual environment in ``/tmp`` using the ``python3`` binary, which is equivalent to making a virtual environment like so: ``virtualenv ~/venv -p /bin/python3``."

#: ../../library/automation/tasks.rst:475
#: ../../library/automation/tasks.rst:492
msgid ""
"If you wish to install additional Python packages into the virtual "
"environment, put them in ``pip`` format and space-separated into the "
"ADDITIONAL PACKAGES field on the Python Task. Use the help text below the"
" field to ensure correct formatting."
msgstr "Si you wish to install additional Python packages into the virtual environment, put them in ``pip`` format and space-separated into the ADDITIONAL PACKAGES field on the Python Tarea. Use the help text below the field to ensure correct formatting."

#: ../../library/automation/tasks.rst:477
msgid "**CentOS 8 and Python**"
msgstr "**CentOS 8 and Python**"

#: ../../library/automation/tasks.rst:479
msgid ""
"In CentOS 8, Python is not installed by default. There is a ``platform-"
"python`` but that should not be used for anything in userland. The error "
"message with a default install of CentOS 8 will be similar to this:"
msgstr "In CentOS 8, Python es ningún installed por default. There es un/una ``platform-python`` but ese/esa debería/n ningún be utilizado/utilizada para anything en userland. El/La error message con un/una predeterminado/predeterminada install de CentOS 8 será/n be similar a this:"

#: ../../library/automation/tasks.rst:481
msgid ""
"Task Execution Failed on Attempt 1\n"
"sudo: /tmp/py-cffc9a8f-c40d-451d-956e-d6e9185ade33/bin/python: command "
"not found"
msgstr "Tarea Execution Failed on Attempt 1\nsudo: /tmp/py-cffc9a8f-c40d-451d-956e-d6e9185ade33/bin/python: command not found"

#: ../../library/automation/tasks.rst:486
msgid ""
"The default ``virtualenv`` for CentOS 8 is the python3 variety, for "
"|morpheus| to use Python Tasks, do the following: ``yum install "
"python3-virtualenv``"
msgstr "El/La predeterminado/predeterminada ``virtualenv`` para CentOS 8 es el/la python3 variety, para |morpheus| a use Python Tareas, do el/la following: ``yum install python3-virtualenv``"

#: ../../library/automation/tasks.rst:488
msgid ""
"If Python2 is required, do the following: ``yum install python2`` and "
"specify ``/bin/python2`` as the PYTHON BINARY in your |morpheus| Task."
msgstr "Si Python2 is required, do the following: ``yum install python2`` and specify ``/bin/python2`` as the PYTHON BINARY in your |morpheus| Tarea."

#: ../../library/automation/tasks.rst:490
msgid ""
"This will build a ``virtualenv`` in ``/tmp`` using the ``python2`` "
"binary, which is equivalent to making a ``virtualenv`` like so: "
"``virtualenv ~/venv -p /bin/python2``"
msgstr "Este/Esta será/n build un/una ``virtualenv`` en ``/tmp`` using el/la ``python2`` binary, el/la cual es equivalent a making un/una ``virtualenv`` like so: ``virtualenv ~/venv -p /bin/python2``"

#: ../../library/automation/tasks.rst:508
msgid "**SUDO:** Mark the box to run the script as ``sudo``"
msgstr "**SUDO:** Mark the box to run the script as ``sudo``"

#: ../../library/automation/tasks.rst:509
msgid ""
"**CONTENT:** Script to execute is entered here if not pulled in from an "
"outside repository"
msgstr "**CONTENT:** Script a execute es entered here si ningún pulled en desde un/una outside repository"

#: ../../library/automation/tasks.rst:513
msgid ""
"When the EXECUTE TARGET option is set to \"Local\" (in other words, the "
"Task is run on the appliance itself), two additional fields are revealed:"
" GIT REPO and GIT REF. Use GIT REPO to set the PWD shell variable "
"(identifies the current working directory) to the locally cached "
"repository (ex. /var/opt/morpheus-node/morpheus-"
"local/repo/git/76fecffdf1fe96516e90becdab9de) and GIT REF to identify the"
" Git branch the Task should be run from if the default (typically main or"
" master) shouldn't be used. If these options are not set, the working "
"folder will be /opt/morpheus/lib/tomcat/temp which would not allow "
"scripts to reference file paths relative to the repository (if needed)."
msgstr "Cuando the EXECUTE TARGET option is set to \"Local\" (in other words, the Tarea is run on the appliance itself), two additional fields are revealed: GIT REPO and GIT REF. Use GIT REPO to set the PWD shell variable (identifies the current working directory) to the locally cached repository (ex. /var/opt/morpheus-node/morpheus-local/repo/git/76fecffdf1fe96516e90becdab9de) and GIT REF to identify the Git branch the Tarea should be run from if the default (typically main or master) shouldn't be used. If these options are not set, the working folder will be /opt/morpheus/lib/tomcat/temp which would not allow scripts to reference file paths relative to the repository (if needed)."

