#: ../../library/automation/tasks/taskResults.rst:8
msgid ""
"Using Task results, the output from any preceding Tasks within the same "
"Workflow phase is available to be called into additional Tasks. The "
"results are stored on the ``results`` variable. Since results are "
"available to all Tasks, we can use results from any or all prior Tasks so"
" long as they are executed within the same provision phase."
msgstr "Using Tarea results, el/la output desde cualquier preceding Tareas dentro de el/la mismo/misma Flujo de trabajo phase es disponible a be called en additional Tareas. El/La results son stored en el/la ``results`` variable. Since results son disponible a todos/todas Tareas, we puede/n use results desde cualquier o todos/todas prior Tareas so long como they son executed dentro de el/la mismo/misma provision phase."

#: ../../library/automation/tasks/taskResults.rst:10
msgid ""
"In script type tasks, if a RESULT TYPE is set, |morpheus| will store the "
"output on the ``results`` variable. It's important to understand that the"
" result type indicates the format of the Task output |morpheus| should "
"expect. |morpheus| will parse that output into a Groovy map which can be "
"retrieved and further parsed by resolving the ``results`` variable. If "
"the RESULT TYPE is incorrectly set, |morpheus| may not be able to store "
"the Task results correctly. Jump to the section on `Script Config "
"Examples "
"<https://docs.morpheusdata.com/en/latest/library/automation/tasks/taskResults.html"
"#results-types>`_ to see how script results are processed in various "
"example cases."
msgstr "In script type tasks, if a RESULT TYPE is set, |morpheus| will store the output on the ``results`` variable. It's important to understand that the result type indicates the format of the Tarea output |morpheus| should expect. |morpheus| will parse that output into a Groovy map which puede ser retrieved and further parsed by resolving the ``results`` variable. If the RESULT TYPE is incorrectly set, |morpheus| may not be able to store the Tarea results correctly. Jump to the section on `Script Config Examples <https://docs.morpheusdata.com/en/latest/library/automation/tasks/taskResults.html#results-types>`_ to see how script results are processed in various example cases."

