msgid "Key/Value pairs"
msgstr "Key/Value pairs"

#: ../../library/automation/tasks/taskResults.rst:18
msgid ""
"Expects ``key=value,key=value`` output. Entire task output is available "
"with ``<%=results.taskCode%>`` or ``<%=results[\"Task Name\"]%>`` "
"variable (output inside ``[]``). Individual Values are available with "
"``<%=results.taskCode.key%>`` variables."
msgstr "Expects ``key=value,key=value`` output. Entire task output es disponible con ``<%=results.taskCode%>`` o ``<%=results[\"Tarea Name\"]%>`` variable (output inside ``[]``). Individual Values son disponible con ``<%=results.taskCode.key%>`` variables."

