#: ../../library/automation/tasks/taskResults.rst:22
msgid ""
"The entire output of a script is treated as results, not just the last "
"line. Ensure formatting is correct for the appropriate result type. For "
"example, if Results Type is ``json`` and the output is not fully json "
"compatible, the result would not return properly."
msgstr "El/La entire output de un/una script es treated como results, ningún just el/la último/última line. Ensure formatting es correct para el/la appropriate result type. For example, si Results Type es ``json`` y el/la output es ningún fully json compatible, el/la result would ningún return properly."

